description:
Rule 6 — qa-testing

Purpose: Garantir qualité via Playwright (flows, edge cases, responsive, a11y).
Trigger: avant merge/release, J4–J5.
Inputs: critères d’acceptation, URL preview.
Output (Notion + artifacts):

QA Report (Blocker/High/Medium/Nit)

Screenshots (3 viewports)

Scripts tests/e2e/*.spec.ts

Steps

Dériver cas de test depuis acceptance criteria.

Lancer 3 viewports (1440, 768, 375).

Tester happy path, erreurs, empty/loading.

Vérifier a11y clavier (tab/focus/enter/space).

Capturer screenshots/console logs.

Triage + création tickets.

Do: preuves concrètes, messages reproductibles.
Don’t: “ça marche chez moi” sans artefacts.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---
